Dialogue: 1,0:01:00.37,0:01:02.58,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,该来创造艺术了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.37,0:01:02.58,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Time to make art
Dialogue: 1,0:01:02.70,0:01:05.00,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,未完待续
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.70,0:01:05.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,To be continued?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:07.04,0:01:09.71,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那些白痴现在是在干嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.04,0:01:09.71,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What are those dolts up to now?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:09.71,0:01:13.76,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,美人鱼战士和企鹅男孩要完蛋了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.71,0:01:13.76,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Mermaid Man and Barnacle Boy are doomed
Dialogue: 1,0:01:13.76,0:01:15.13,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,跟你说  完蛋了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.76,0:01:15.13,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Doomed, I tell ya
Dialogue: 1,0:01:15.13,0:01:15.93,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,完蛋了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.13,0:01:15.93,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Doomed
Dialogue: 1,0:01:16.18,0:01:18.89,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,小点声  你们两个白痴
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.18,0:01:18.89,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Keep it down, you numbskulls
Dialogue: 1,0:01:18.89,0:01:20.56,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,章鱼哥  说来你肯定不信
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.89,0:01:20.56,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Squidward, you won't believe it
Dialogue: 1,0:01:20.56,0:01:23.89,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,最新一期美人鱼战士和企鹅男孩结尾
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.56,0:01:21.56,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The latest issue
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.56,0:01:23.89,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,of Mermaid Man and Barnacle Boy ends in
Dialogue: 1,0:01:24.43,0:01:26.19,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,是个悬念
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.43,0:01:26.19,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,a cliffhanger
Dialogue: 1,0:01:26.19,0:01:29.61,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就为了本垃圾漫画书闹成这样
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.19,0:01:29.61,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,All this over a garbage comic book?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:29.81,0:01:32.86,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我多半都能画本更好看的漫画书
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.81,0:01:32.86,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I could probably write a better comic book
Dialogue: 1,0:01:32.86,0:01:36.32,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就算把我三只触手绑在背后都行
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.86,0:01:36.32,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,with three tentacles tied behind my back
Dialogue: 1,0:01:36.32,0:01:39.74,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我好想看那本漫画书  章鱼哥
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.32,0:01:39.74,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I would love to read that comic book, Squidward
Dialogue: 1,0:01:40.07,0:01:41.99,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我那是在讽刺
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.07,0:01:41.99,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That was sarcasm
Dialogue: 1,0:01:41.99,0:01:46.16,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,才不可能堕落到画漫画书的地步
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.99,0:01:46.16,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I would never stoop so low as to make a comic book
Dialogue: 1,0:01:46.54,0:01:48.46,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,求你了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.54,0:01:48.46,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Please
Dialogue: 1,0:01:48.46,0:01:50.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,滚开
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.46,0:01:50.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Go away
Dialogue: 1,0:01:53.50,0:01:57.97,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,求你了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.50,0:01:57.97,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Please
Dialogue: 1,0:02:00.26,0:02:02.39,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,求你了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.26,0:02:02.39,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Please
Dialogue: 1,0:02:03.35,0:02:06.77,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,要是我给你们俩白痴画本破漫画书
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.35,0:02:06.77,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,If I make you idiots a stupid comic book
Dialogue: 1,0:02:06.77,0:02:09.35,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,可以离我远一点吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.77,0:02:09.35,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,will you leave me alone?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:09.60,0:02:11.90,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不言而喻
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.60,0:02:11.90,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I believe that is implied
Dialogue: 1,0:02:12.36,0:02:14.28,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,行吧  画就画
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.36,0:02:14.28,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Fine, I'll do it
Dialogue: 1,0:02:16.32,0:02:18.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,75,,五分钟后
Dialogue: 1,0:02:18.49,0:02:21.24,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你们的破漫画书拿去
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.49,0:02:21.24,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Here's your stupid comic book
Dialogue: 1,0:02:23.58,0:02:25.66,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,超级白痴
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.58,0:02:25.66,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,"Super Imbeciles
Dialogue: 1,0:02:25.66,0:02:29.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,呆大腥和海绵笨笨主演
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.66,0:02:29.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,starring Dum-Star and Stupidity-Sponge"?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:30.12,0:02:31.63,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.12,0:02:31.63,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Awesome
Dialogue: 1,0:02:32.09,0:02:33.38,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,傻子
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.09,0:02:33.38,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Simpletons
Dialogue: 1,0:02:38.76,0:02:40.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,危险要降临了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.76,0:02:40.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Danger is afoot
Dialogue: 1,0:02:40.97,0:02:42.26,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,又怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.97,0:02:42.26,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What now?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:44.64,0:02:45.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不好了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.64,0:02:45.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh, no
Dialogue: 1,0:02:45.72,0:02:47.98,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,嘎嘎怪在袭击市政厅
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.72,0:02:47.98,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The Quacken is attacking city hall
Dialogue: 1,0:02:52.02,0:02:53.56,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这时候就要出动
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.02,0:02:53.56,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,This is a job for
Dialogue: 1,0:02:54.02,0:02:56.78,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,超级白痴
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.02,0:02:56.78,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The Super Imbeciles
Dialogue: 1,0:02:56.78,0:02:59.70,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我是海绵笨笨
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.78,0:02:59.70,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I am Stupidity-Sponge
Dialogue: 1,0:02:59.70,0:03:02.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,超能力是吸收环境中的傻气
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.70,0:03:02.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,With the power to absorb ambient stupid
Dialogue: 1,0:03:02.95,0:03:06.58,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,转化成笨蛋光波
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.95,0:03:06.58,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and turn it into a buffoonery blast
Dialogue: 1,0:03:11.08,0:03:13.33,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我是呆大腥
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.08,0:03:13.33,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And I'm Dum-Star
Dialogue: 1,0:03:13.33,0:03:17.38,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,超能力是吃掉普通垃圾箱里的垃圾
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.33,0:03:15.29,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,With the power to take garbage
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.29,0:03:17.38,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,from an ordinary dumpster
Dialogue: 1,0:03:18.97,0:03:21.84,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,转化成超级力量
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.97,0:03:21.84,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and turn it into super strength
Dialogue: 1,0:03:26.51,0:03:28.93,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你们两个呆头在干嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.51,0:03:28.93,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What are you muffin-heads doing?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:28.93,0:03:31.77,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们在角色扮演你新画的超棒漫画书
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.93,0:03:31.77,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We're play-tending your awesome new comic book
Dialogue: 1,0:03:31.77,0:03:33.56,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,超级白痴啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.77,0:03:33.56,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Super Imbeciles
Dialogue: 1,0:03:33.56,0:03:35.94,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,章鱼哥  我们爱你的漫画
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.56,0:03:35.94,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Squidward, we love your comic
Dialogue: 1,0:03:36.23,0:03:39.03,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,简直是史上最棒的超级英雄冒险
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.23,0:03:39.03,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's the best superhero adventure ever
Dialogue: 1,0:03:39.03,0:03:42.86,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,既然你们两个喜欢  那它果然是垃圾
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.03,0:03:42.86,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, if you two like it, I know it's garbage
Dialogue: 1,0:03:42.86,0:03:43.74,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,快滚
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.86,0:03:43.74,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Now, beat it
Dialogue: 1,0:03:45.91,0:03:48.54,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他的漫画才不是垃圾
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.91,0:03:48.54,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I don't think his comic is garbage
Dialogue: 1,0:03:48.54,0:03:51.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我就很懂垃圾
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.54,0:03:51.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and I know garbage
Dialogue: 1,0:03:53.75,0:03:55.88,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,只有一个办法可以确定
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.75,0:03:55.88,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,There's one way to know for sure
Dialogue: 1,0:03:55.88,0:03:56.79,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,把它献给
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.88,0:03:56.79,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Show it to
Dialogue: 1,0:03:57.13,0:03:58.88,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,阿宅之王过目
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.13,0:03:58.88,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,the king of the nerds
Dialogue: 1,0:04:03.22,0:04:05.76,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,上前来  给本王示出
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.22,0:04:05.76,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Come forward and show my royalness
Dialogue: 1,0:04:05.76,0:04:08.35,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你们带来了什么收藏品
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.76,0:04:08.35,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,what collectibles you have brought
Dialogue: 1,0:04:08.35,0:04:11.48,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们谦卑地把这本书献给你锐评
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.35,0:04:11.48,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We have humbly brought this for you to judge
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.64,0:04:11.48,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1028,192)}超级白痴
Dialogue: 1,0:04:12.85,0:04:14.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,很好
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.85,0:04:14.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Very well
Dialogue: 1,0:04:14.10,0:04:18.82,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我从不错过任何机会磨砺蔑视之剑
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.10,0:04:18.82,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I never miss a chance to sharpen my rapier-like scorn
Dialogue: 1,0:04:32.87,0:04:34.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这本漫画并不好
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.87,0:04:34.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,This comic isn't good
Dialogue: 1,0:04:36.92,0:04:40.13,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,是史上最棒的漫画
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.92,0:04:40.13,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's the best comic ever created
Dialogue: 1,0:04:42.13,0:04:49.64,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,快加印这本书  发给海底所有漫画店
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.13,0:04:46.09,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Now go forth and duplicate this book
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.09,0:04:49.64,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,for comic stores across the ocean
Dialogue: 1,0:04:50.77,0:04:53.31,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我要在博客上写好评
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.77,0:04:53.31,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,While I review it on my blog
Dialogue: 1,0:04:53.89,0:04:56.81,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,全世界都得知道它有多棒
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.89,0:04:56.81,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The world shall know its greatness
Dialogue: 1,0:05:05.11,0:05:09.03,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他们是在看我的漫画书吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.11,0:05:09.03,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Are they reading my comic book?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:14.21,0:05:17.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那公交上的所有人是不是也在看我的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.21,0:05:17.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Was everyone on that bus also reading my
Dialogue: 1,0:05:18.96,0:05:20.34,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,漫画书
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.96,0:05:20.34,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,comic book?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:21.00,0:05:22.71,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.00,0:05:22.71,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:24.22,0:05:28.85,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我的破烂垃圾漫画书哪来这么多副本
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.22,0:05:25.68,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Where did all these copies
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.68,0:05:28.85,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,of my stupid garbage comic book come from?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:29.89,0:05:31.76,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.89,0:05:31.76,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,0:05:31.76,0:05:33.22,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,是原作者
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.76,0:05:33.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The creator
Dialogue: 1,0:05:33.22,0:05:34.39,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,签名
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.22,0:05:34.39,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sign
Dialogue: 1,0:05:34.73,0:05:35.64,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,签名
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.73,0:05:35.64,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sign
Dialogue: 1,0:05:35.64,0:05:36.77,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,签绘
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.64,0:05:36.77,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sketch
Dialogue: 1,0:05:36.77,0:05:37.94,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,签名
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.77,0:05:37.94,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sign
Dialogue: 1,0:05:38.23,0:05:39.44,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,签绘
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.23,0:05:39.44,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sketch
Dialogue: 1,0:05:39.44,0:05:41.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,签名
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.44,0:05:41.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sign
Dialogue: 1,0:05:41.15,0:05:42.44,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,签绘
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.15,0:05:42.44,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sketch
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.44,0:05:46.95,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(474,236)}蟹堡王
Dialogue: 1,0:05:50.24,0:05:52.24,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,外面有一伙暴民
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.24,0:05:52.24,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,There's a mob out there
Dialogue: 1,0:05:52.24,0:05:57.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,都怪你们让我画那本破漫画书
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.24,0:05:53.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And it's your fault
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.37,0:05:57.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,for making me make that stupid comic book
Dialogue: 1,0:05:57.50,0:05:58.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不客气
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.50,0:05:58.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You're welcome
Dialogue: 1,0:05:59.08,0:05:59.38,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.08,0:05:59.38,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I--
Dialogue: 1,0:05:59.38,0:06:00.04,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不什么了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.38,0:06:00.04,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm what?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:00.21,0:06:02.00,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这些是你的粉丝  章鱼哥
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.21,0:06:02.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,These are your fans, Squidward
Dialogue: 1,0:06:02.00,0:06:04.05,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他们特别爱你的漫画书
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.00,0:06:04.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,They love your comic book
Dialogue: 1,0:06:04.05,0:06:07.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们印了好多副本  发给了漫画店
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.05,0:06:07.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We made lots of copies to put in the comic book store
Dialogue: 1,0:06:07.80,0:06:10.68,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,现在全裤头村都爱着你
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.80,0:06:10.68,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And now the whole town loves you
Dialogue: 1,0:06:10.68,0:06:12.97,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,因为你终于创作出了艺术
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.68,0:06:12.97,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,for finally making art
Dialogue: 1,0:06:12.97,0:06:13.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,艺术
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.97,0:06:13.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Art?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:13.72,0:06:15.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那不叫艺术
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.72,0:06:15.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That's not art
Dialogue: 1,0:06:15.27,0:06:19.02,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,是我为了嘲你俩白痴随便搞的垃圾
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.27,0:06:19.02,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That's junk I slopped out to make fun of you two idiots
Dialogue: 1,0:06:19.02,0:06:21.61,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,可你向来都很想出名啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.02,0:06:21.61,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,But you always wanted to be famous
Dialogue: 1,0:06:21.94,0:06:24.86,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我是想靠创作艺术出名
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.94,0:06:24.86,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I wanted to be famous for making art
Dialogue: 1,0:06:24.86,0:06:26.99,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不是画漫画出名
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.86,0:06:26.99,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,not comic books
Dialogue: 1,0:06:27.19,0:06:30.70,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,才不想跟你们这伙阿宅为伍
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.19,0:06:30.70,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I do not want to be associated with nerds like you
Dialogue: 1,0:06:30.70,0:06:32.58,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,签名
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.70,0:06:32.58,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sign
Dialogue: 1,0:06:32.58,0:06:35.58,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,现在那么说好像有点晚了  章鱼哥
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.58,0:06:35.58,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I think it's a little late for that, Squidward
Dialogue: 1,0:06:35.58,0:06:40.08,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,签名
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.58,0:06:40.08,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sign
Dialogue: 1,0:06:40.92,0:06:42.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,放心  章鱼哥先生
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.92,0:06:42.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, Mr. Squidward
Dialogue: 1,0:06:42.92,0:06:44.38,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我来搞定
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.92,0:06:44.38,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'll take care of this
Dialogue: 1,0:06:44.92,0:06:46.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,谢谢  蟹老板
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.92,0:06:46.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Mr. Krabs
Dialogue: 1,0:06:46.92,0:06:48.88,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,都给我听好
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.92,0:06:48.88,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Alright, listen up
Dialogue: 1,0:06:48.88,0:06:51.09,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这里还得办生意
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.88,0:06:51.09,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,This here be a place of business
Dialogue: 1,0:06:51.09,0:06:52.76,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,签名
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.09,0:06:52.76,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sign
Dialogue: 1,0:06:53.85,0:06:56.35,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,要想让章鱼哥给你们漫画签名
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.85,0:06:56.35,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Squidward will only sign your comic
Dialogue: 1,0:06:56.64,0:06:58.35,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就得先买一份蟹黄堡
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.64,0:06:58.35,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,with a purchase of a Krabby Patty
Dialogue: 1,0:07:02.65,0:07:03.69,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,果不其然
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.65,0:07:03.69,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Typical
Dialogue: 1,0:07:04.07,0:07:06.57,标准-Chi,,0,0,75,,签了几百份名之后
Dialogue: 1,0:07:06.57,0:07:09.86,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,签名
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.57,0:07:09.86,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sign
Dialogue: 1,0:07:12.62,0:07:13.78,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,下一位
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.62,0:07:13.78,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Next
Dialogue: 1,0:07:13.78,0:07:17.24,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,一份蟹黄堡加一份签名
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.78,0:07:17.24,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,One Krabby Patty and one autograph
Dialogue: 1,0:07:17.50,0:07:20.04,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,签名要配薯条吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.50,0:07:20.04,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Would you like fries with that autograph?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:20.04,0:07:24.63,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,当然了  不过我还要你漫画的第二期
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.04,0:07:22.04,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Of course, but I would also like
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.04,0:07:24.63,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,a second issue of your comic book
Dialogue: 1,0:07:24.63,0:07:25.67,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.63,0:07:25.67,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh, no
Dialogue: 1,0:07:25.88,0:07:29.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,再也不为你们这群白眼狼贬低身价了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.88,0:07:29.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I have cheapened myself enough for you ingrates
Dialogue: 1,0:07:29.42,0:07:30.84,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,别想再让我画
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.42,0:07:30.84,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No more
Dialogue: 1,0:07:33.68,0:07:46.40,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,第二期什么时候出
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.68,0:07:46.40,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,When's the second issue?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:47.44,0:07:48.86,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,离我远一点
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.44,0:07:48.86,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Stay away from me
Dialogue: 1,0:07:48.86,0:07:52.24,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,第二期
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.86,0:07:52.24,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Second issue
Dialogue: 1,0:07:52.24,0:07:53.91,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这里是警察局  有什么紧急情况
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.24,0:07:53.91,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Police, what's your emergency?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:54.16,0:07:55.74,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我是章鱼哥
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.16,0:07:55.74,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,This is Squidward Tentacles
Dialogue: 1,0:07:55.74,0:07:59.33,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,困在一个电话亭里  被一群阿宅包围
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.74,0:07:57.28,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm trapped in a phone booth
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.28,0:07:59.33,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,surrounded by a bunch of nerds
Dialogue: 1,0:07:59.33,0:08:00.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,快来救我
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.33,0:08:00.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Send help
Dialogue: 1,0:08:01.12,0:08:03.96,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,等你画第二期我们就来救你
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.12,0:08:03.96,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We'll send help when you make a second issue
Dialogue: 1,0:08:04.75,0:08:06.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好  算你们赢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.75,0:08:06.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Alright, you win
Dialogue: 1,0:08:07.50,0:08:09.88,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我会做第二期的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.50,0:08:09.88,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'll make a second issue
Dialogue: 1,0:08:14.18,0:08:17.56,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,既然无知的大众想要第二期
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.18,0:08:17.56,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,If the great unwashed masses want a second issue
Dialogue: 1,0:08:17.56,0:08:18.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就给他们第二期
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.56,0:08:18.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,they'll get it
Dialogue: 1,0:08:18.72,0:08:19.93,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,至于这次
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.72,0:08:19.93,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,But this time
Dialogue: 1,0:08:19.93,0:08:23.56,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就给他们真正的艺术
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.93,0:08:23.56,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna give them real art
Dialogue: 1,0:08:27.48,0:08:29.40,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,深入挖掘  章鱼哥
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.48,0:08:29.40,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Dig deep, Squidward
Dialogue: 1,0:08:29.65,0:08:31.32,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,创作艺术
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.65,0:08:31.32,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,make art
Dialogue: 1,0:08:35.61,0:08:38.08,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,一定要再深入
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.61,0:08:38.08,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Must go deeper
Dialogue: 1,0:09:00.51,0:09:01.22,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,成功了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.51,0:09:01.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I did it
Dialogue: 1,0:09:01.72,0:09:03.18,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,成功了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.72,0:09:03.18,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I did it
Dialogue: 1,0:09:03.18,0:09:05.60,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我创作出了艺术
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.18,0:09:05.60,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I made art
Dialogue: 1,0:09:06.23,0:09:09.19,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,漫画艺术
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.23,0:09:09.19,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Comic art
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.07,0:09:13.57,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1098,164)}超棒漫画店
Dialogue: 1,0:09:11.28,0:09:13.57,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,超级白痴第二期今天发布
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.28,0:09:13.57,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Super Imbeciles second issue out today
Dialogue: 1,0:09:13.57,0:09:16.49,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,作者章鱼哥亲自光临现场
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.57,0:09:16.49,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Creator Squidward Tentacles here in person
Dialogue: 1,0:09:16.86,0:09:19.16,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好了  蠢货
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.86,0:09:19.16,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Alright, mouth breathers
Dialogue: 1,0:09:19.16,0:09:25.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你们求我要第二期  那我就呈上巨作
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.16,0:09:22.08,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,you begged me for a second issue
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.08,0:09:25.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and I delivered a masterpiece
Dialogue: 1,0:09:25.75,0:09:29.09,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,万岁
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.75,0:09:29.09,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Huzzah
Dialogue: 1,0:09:29.09,0:09:33.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,准备好观赏你们所见最棒的漫画
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.09,0:09:33.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Get ready for the greatest comic you've ever seen
Dialogue: 1,0:09:33.17,0:09:35.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,超级白痴二
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.17,0:09:35.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Super Imbeciles 2
Dialogue: 1,0:09:36.13,0:09:38.59,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,嘎嘎怪的哀叹
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.13,0:09:38.59,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The Quacken's Lament
Dialogue: 1,0:09:49.52,0:09:50.02,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.52,0:09:50.02,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:01.28,0:10:04.58,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我宣布这本漫画书是
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.28,0:10:04.58,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I declare this comic book to be
Dialogue: 1,0:10:06.16,0:10:07.71,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,垃圾
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.16,0:10:07.71,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,garbage
Dialogue: 1,0:10:07.71,0:10:08.79,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,等等  什么
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.71,0:10:08.79,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Wait, what?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:08.79,0:10:10.79,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,图画得烂透了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.79,0:10:10.79,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The artwork stinks
Dialogue: 1,0:10:10.79,0:10:13.09,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,剧情华而不实
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.79,0:10:13.09,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The story is ostentatious
Dialogue: 1,0:10:13.09,0:10:17.26,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,对话就是首连韵都不押的长诗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.09,0:10:15.38,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and the dialogue is one long poem
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.38,0:10:17.26,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,that doesn't even rhyme
Dialogue: 1,0:10:17.26,0:10:19.14,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我宁愿盯着太阳
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.26,0:10:19.14,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'd rather look at the sun
Dialogue: 1,0:10:19.14,0:10:22.89,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,也不再看一页嘎嘎怪的哀叹
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.14,0:10:22.89,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,than read another page of the The Quacken's Lament
Dialogue: 1,0:10:25.85,0:10:27.14,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好多了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.85,0:10:27.14,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That's better
Dialogue: 1,0:10:27.14,0:10:28.35,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,白眼狼
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.14,0:10:28.35,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Ingrates
Dialogue: 1,0:10:28.60,0:10:31.77,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我为那本书倾注了心血
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.60,0:10:31.77,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I poured my heart and soul into that book
Dialogue: 1,0:10:31.77,0:10:35.19,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,错根本不在我  而是你们太笨
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.77,0:10:35.19,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's not my fault you don't have the intellectual
Dialogue: 1,0:10:35.19,0:10:39.28,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没有艺术敏感度  所以不懂我的大作
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.19,0:10:39.28,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and artistic sensitivity to understand my work
Dialogue: 1,0:10:41.03,0:10:42.41,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,是嘎嘎怪
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.03,0:10:42.41,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's the Quacken
Dialogue: 1,0:10:42.78,0:10:44.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我有足够的敏感度  所以很清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.78,0:10:44.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I am sensitive enough to know
Dialogue: 1,0:10:45.29,0:10:47.54,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你对嘎嘎怪的描绘
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.29,0:10:47.54,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,that your portrayal of Quackens
Dialogue: 1,0:10:47.54,0:10:49.08,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,十分无礼
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.54,0:10:49.08,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,is offensive
Dialogue: 1,0:10:49.08,0:10:51.58,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,真的有嘎嘎怪
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.08,0:10:51.58,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Quackens exist?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:52.04,0:10:54.80,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,让我这么说吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.04,0:10:54.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Let me put it this way
Dialogue: 1,0:11:03.01,0:11:04.43,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,跳梁小丑
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.01,0:11:04.43,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What a wannabe
Dialogue: 1,0:11:04.85,0:11:06.35,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,太烂了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.85,0:11:06.35,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,This is terrible
Dialogue: 1,0:11:07.18,0:11:11.56,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,至少我再也不用画漫画了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.18,0:11:11.56,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, at least I'm finally finished drawing comics
Dialogue: 1,0:11:11.81,0:11:14.73,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,超级白痴  合为一体
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.81,0:11:14.73,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Super Imbeciles, unite
Dialogue: 1,0:11:16.36,0:11:18.57,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你粉丝都哪去了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.36,0:11:18.57,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Where are all your fans?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:18.86,0:11:21.32,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他们都讨厌第二期
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.86,0:11:21.32,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,They all hated the second issue
Dialogue: 1,0:11:21.53,0:11:24.07,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我再也没粉丝了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.53,0:11:24.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I have no more fans
Dialogue: 1,0:11:24.07,0:11:25.66,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没事  章鱼哥
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.07,0:11:25.66,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, Squidward
Dialogue: 1,0:11:25.66,0:11:28.45,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我跟派大星永远都会是你粉丝
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.66,0:11:28.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Patrick and I will always be your fans
Dialogue: 1,0:11:28.45,0:11:33.54,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,对  我们会一直催你画新作哦
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.45,0:11:33.54,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yeah, and we'll never stop asking for new issues
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.76,0:11:42.34,起司 一般标题,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\fsp40\c&H00FFC1&}海绵的方法派
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.55,0:11:43.72,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\frz28.74\pos(752,430)}编剧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.55,0:11:43.72,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\frz28.74\pos(770,722)}分镜总监
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.55,0:11:48.18,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1530,976.667)}翻译{\fnArial}: 1440kHz
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.01,0:11:45.18,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\frz28.74\pos(636,484)}指导总监
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.01,0:11:45.18,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\frz28.74\pos(800,700)}动画总监
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.47,0:11:46.64,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\frz28.74\pos(740,548)}统筹
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.93,0:11:48.10,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\frz28.74\pos(596,560)}监制
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.39,0:11:49.81,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\frz28.74\pos(640,598)}监制
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.39,0:11:49.81,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1468.667,976.667)}本字幕仅限学习交流\N严禁用于商业用途
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.06,0:11:51.77,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(378,372)}蟹堡王
Dialogue: 1,0:11:53.48,0:11:54.94,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好消息  章鱼哥先生
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.48,0:11:54.94,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Great news, Mr. Squidward
Dialogue: 1,0:11:54.94,0:11:57.69,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我找到靠我餐厅赚更多钱的办法了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.94,0:11:56.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I've found a way to make even more money
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.52,0:11:57.69,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,from me restaurant
Dialogue: 1,0:11:58.23,0:12:00.61,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我都抑制不住自己的喜悦了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.23,0:12:00.61,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I can hardly contain my joy
Dialogue: 1,0:12:02.03,0:12:03.24,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好耶
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.03,0:12:03.24,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yeah
Dialogue: 1,0:12:03.74,0:12:06.24,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,又有收入来源了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.74,0:12:06.24,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Additional revenue streams?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:06.24,0:12:07.70,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,万岁
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.24,0:12:07.70,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hooray
Dialogue: 1,0:12:07.70,0:12:08.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.70,0:12:08.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That's right
Dialogue: 1,0:12:08.62,0:12:12.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我把蟹堡王租出去当电影片场了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.62,0:12:12.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm renting out the Krusty Krab for a movie location
Dialogue: 1,0:12:13.79,0:12:17.00,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,电影是白痴专属的婴儿食品
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.79,0:12:17.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Movies are pablum for simple minds
Dialogue: 1,0:12:17.00,0:12:18.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好耶
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.00,0:12:18.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh, boy
Dialogue: 1,0:12:18.42,0:12:20.59,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我爱电影
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.42,0:12:20.59,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I love movies
Dialogue: 1,0:12:21.84,0:12:22.97,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,论证完毕
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.84,0:12:22.97,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I rest my case
Dialogue: 1,0:12:24.68,0:12:26.64,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,很高兴你这么说  小子
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.68,0:12:26.64,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, it's good to hear, son
Dialogue: 1,0:12:26.64,0:12:31.23,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,因为电影的主角要来跟你实地学习
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.64,0:12:31.23,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,because the star of the film wants to shadow you
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.64,0:12:31.23,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\fs60\pos(1390,920)}影 子
Dialogue: 1,0:12:31.77,0:12:33.14,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我已经有影子了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.77,0:12:33.14,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I already have a shadow
Dialogue: 1,0:12:33.14,0:12:33.73,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你看
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.14,0:12:33.73,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,See?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:39.36,0:12:41.32,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那你马上能再多一个影子了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.36,0:12:41.32,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, you're getting a second one
Dialogue: 1,0:12:41.94,0:12:44.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,影子  你要有弟弟了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.94,0:12:44.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Shadow, you're getting a brother
Dialogue: 1,0:12:45.36,0:12:47.32,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,马林白鲈度
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.36,0:12:47.32,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Marlin Branzino
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.36,0:12:47.32,注释,,0,0,0,,[ 改自马龙·白兰度，代表作《教父》 ]
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.28,0:12:49.33,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1530,884)}马林
Dialogue: 1,0:12:47.32,0:12:49.33,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他是那种高级的方法派演员
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.32,0:12:49.33,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,He's one of those fancy method actors
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.32,0:12:49.33,注释,,0,0,0,,[ 方法派：强调演员深入体验角色内心\N以真实情感塑造人物的表演方法 ]
Dialogue: 1,0:12:49.58,0:12:53.25,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,演的是个煎炸厨师  想来学习你
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.58,0:12:53.25,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,He's playing a fry cook, and he wants to study you
Dialogue: 1,0:12:53.66,0:12:54.33,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.66,0:12:54.33,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Wait
Dialogue: 1,0:12:54.33,0:12:56.08,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,马林白鲈度
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.33,0:12:56.08,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Marlin Branzino?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:56.25,0:12:59.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他可是全海洋最伟大的演员
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.25,0:12:59.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,He's the greatest actor in the entire ocean
Dialogue: 1,0:12:59.46,0:13:03.26,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,为了演好迷雾管乐十八年里面的角色
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.46,0:13:03.26,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,To prepare for his role in Woodwinds in the Mist
Dialogue: 1,0:13:03.26,0:13:07.64,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他过上六个月体验竖笛生活
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.26,0:13:07.64,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,he spent six months living as an actual clarinet
Dialogue: 1,0:13:07.64,0:13:10.43,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你不是不喜欢电影吗  章鱼哥先生
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.64,0:13:10.43,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I thought you didn't like movies, Mr. Squidward
Dialogue: 1,0:13:10.43,0:13:13.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,马林白鲈度做的不是电影
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.43,0:13:13.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Marlin Branzino doesn't make movies
Dialogue: 1,0:13:13.27,0:13:15.64,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,是神作
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.27,0:13:15.64,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,He makes films
Dialogue: 1,0:13:16.19,0:13:18.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你必须让他学我  蟹老板
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.19,0:13:18.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You have to let him shadow me, Mr. Krabs
Dialogue: 1,0:13:18.15,0:13:18.81,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,求你了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.15,0:13:18.81,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Please
Dialogue: 1,0:13:18.81,0:13:20.36,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我会把自己所知都教给他
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.81,0:13:20.36,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'll teach him everything I know
Dialogue: 1,0:13:20.61,0:13:25.57,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,抱歉  白鲈度不演收银员相关的电影
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.61,0:13:23.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but Mr. Branzino ain't making
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.15,0:13:25.57,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,a movie about cashiers
Dialogue: 1,0:13:25.57,0:13:27.82,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他只要海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.57,0:13:27.82,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,He only wants SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,0:13:28.45,0:13:30.28,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他来了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.45,0:13:30.28,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And here he comes now
Dialogue: 1,0:13:38.88,0:13:40.21,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,对对对
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.88,0:13:40.21,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Right, right, right
Dialogue: 1,0:13:46.38,0:13:48.51,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他当然是专业的  对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.38,0:13:48.51,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, of course, the man's a professional, right?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:48.80,0:13:50.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,可不会退而求其次
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.80,0:13:50.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,He wouldn't settle for less
Dialogue: 1,0:13:51.76,0:13:53.02,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这边
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.76,0:13:53.02,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Here
Dialogue: 1,0:13:53.89,0:13:54.68,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这边请
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.89,0:13:54.68,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Right this way
Dialogue: 1,0:13:54.68,0:13:55.64,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,看这
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.68,0:13:55.64,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Over here
Dialogue: 1,0:13:56.06,0:13:57.73,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我是新鲸报的芙丽蒂姬贝
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.06,0:13:57.73,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Flipperty Gibbet, Cetacean Tattler
Dialogue: 1,0:13:57.73,0:13:59.40,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,白鲈度先生  讲两句吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.73,0:13:59.40,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Mr. Branzino, just a word, just a word
Dialogue: 1,0:13:59.40,0:14:00.06,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,白鲈度先生
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.40,0:14:00.06,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Mr. Branzino
Dialogue: 1,0:14:00.06,0:14:00.44,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,白
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.06,0:14:00.44,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Mr--
Dialogue: 1,0:14:00.44,0:14:01.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他真厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.44,0:14:01.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What a man
Dialogue: 1,0:14:01.52,0:14:02.78,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,各就各位
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.52,0:14:02.78,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Places, lads
Dialogue: 1,0:14:04.19,0:14:05.69,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,啊  白鲈度先生
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.19,0:14:05.69,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Ah, Mr. Branzino
Dialogue: 1,0:14:05.94,0:14:07.91,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,您能光临我这小小的餐厅  真是荣幸
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.94,0:14:07.91,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,A pleasure to have you in me humble restaurant
Dialogue: 1,0:14:08.11,0:14:10.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,有兴趣买个蟹黄堡吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.11,0:14:10.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Would you care to purchase a Krabby Patty?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:10.87,0:14:14.58,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这里有不少昂贵的选择
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.87,0:14:14.58,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We have several very expensive options available
Dialogue: 1,0:14:14.58,0:14:17.33,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没错  这里很完美
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.58,0:14:17.33,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yeah, man, this place is perfect
Dialogue: 1,0:14:18.96,0:14:24.96,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,弥漫着生命困于四堵油墙间的绝望味
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.96,0:14:22.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You can smell the desperation of the lives
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.00,0:14:24.96,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,trapped within these four greasy walls
Dialogue: 1,0:14:26.13,0:14:26.80,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,谢了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.13,0:14:26.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Thank you?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:30.39,0:14:32.01,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,白鲈度先生
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.39,0:14:32.01,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Mr. Branzino
Dialogue: 1,0:14:32.01,0:14:34.68,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,很荣幸能有您这般才华的人莅临
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.01,0:14:34.68,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It is an honor to have someone of your talent here
Dialogue: 1,0:14:34.68,0:14:36.43,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,需要什么服务吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.68,0:14:36.43,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Is there anything I can get you?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:36.43,0:14:37.94,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,您好像着凉了  要穿我衬衣吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.43,0:14:37.94,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You look cold, would you like my shirt?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:37.94,0:14:38.89,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我不需要
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.94,0:14:38.89,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I don't need it
Dialogue: 1,0:14:39.31,0:14:41.06,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,甚至不是我喜欢的颜色
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.31,0:14:41.06,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's not even my color
Dialogue: 1,0:14:45.48,0:14:46.78,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.48,0:14:46.78,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh, no
Dialogue: 1,0:14:46.78,0:14:48.11,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,求您了  马林
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.78,0:14:48.11,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Please, Marlin
Dialogue: 1,0:14:48.70,0:14:49.78,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,可以为我签名吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.70,0:14:49.78,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Can I get an autograph?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:49.99,0:14:50.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,送我一撮头发
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.99,0:14:50.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,A lock of hair?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:50.95,0:14:52.24,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,一张用过的纸巾
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.95,0:14:52.24,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,A used tissue?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:52.24,0:14:53.20,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,什么都行
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.24,0:14:53.20,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Anything
Dialogue: 1,0:14:53.20,0:14:53.45,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.20,0:14:53.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I--
Dialogue: 1,0:14:56.45,0:14:57.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,真是不好意思
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.45,0:14:57.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sorry about that
Dialogue: 1,0:14:57.75,0:14:59.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,毕竟好帮手不好找
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.75,0:14:59.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hard to find good help, you know
Dialogue: 1,0:14:59.71,0:15:01.00,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,还是进厨房吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.71,0:15:01.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Why don't we just go to the kitchen
Dialogue: 1,0:15:01.58,0:15:03.29,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,把您介绍给我的煎炸厨师
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.58,0:15:03.29,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and I can introduce you to me fry cook
Dialogue: 1,0:15:05.46,0:15:06.26,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你好
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.46,0:15:06.26,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hey there
Dialogue: 1,0:15:07.34,0:15:09.51,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,天啊  看看你
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.34,0:15:09.51,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh, man, look at you
Dialogue: 1,0:15:09.88,0:15:11.09,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,多么真实
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.88,0:15:11.09,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,So real
Dialogue: 1,0:15:11.34,0:15:12.76,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,多么正宗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.34,0:15:12.76,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,So authentic
Dialogue: 1,0:15:12.76,0:15:13.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,多么
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.76,0:15:13.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,So
Dialogue: 1,0:15:14.01,0:15:15.64,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,黄
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.01,0:15:15.64,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,yellow
Dialogue: 1,0:15:18.89,0:15:22.90,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你每一个动作都多么丝滑
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.89,0:15:22.90,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Every move you make is so smooth
Dialogue: 1,0:15:23.23,0:15:25.82,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,一辈子的苦差事
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.23,0:15:25.82,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,A lifetime of drudgery
Dialogue: 1,0:15:25.82,0:15:30.61,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不断重复着完善着  终成艺术
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.82,0:15:30.61,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,repeated and perfected until it's art
Dialogue: 1,0:15:30.61,0:15:33.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我爱干苦差事
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.61,0:15:33.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, I do love to drudge
Dialogue: 1,0:15:33.78,0:15:35.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这就是我在寻找的真理
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.78,0:15:35.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,This is the truth I've been seeking
Dialogue: 1,0:15:35.95,0:15:39.29,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,求你了  必须让我跟着你学习
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.95,0:15:39.29,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Please, you must let me study under you
Dialogue: 1,0:15:39.29,0:15:42.88,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我必须学到成为煎炸厨师的所有奥秘
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.29,0:15:42.88,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I have to learn everything about being a fry cook
Dialogue: 1,0:15:43.63,0:15:45.59,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你要深入是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.63,0:15:45.59,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You want the deep dive, huh?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:45.59,0:15:48.84,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我的工作可远远不局限于厨房
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.59,0:15:48.84,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, my job extends far beyond the kitchen
Dialogue: 1,0:15:48.84,0:15:50.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,准备好
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.84,0:15:50.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Prepare yourself
Dialogue: 1,0:15:50.88,0:15:53.84,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,事情马上就要酷起来了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.88,0:15:53.84,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,things are about to get pretty cool
Dialogue: 1,0:16:40.64,0:16:41.64,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.64,0:16:41.64,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Okay
Dialogue: 1,0:16:42.39,0:16:43.94,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,其他的你都学会了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.39,0:16:43.94,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You've learned everything else
Dialogue: 1,0:16:44.23,0:16:46.56,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,现在来做最后一步
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.23,0:16:46.56,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,now it's time for the big finish
Dialogue: 1,0:16:46.98,0:16:49.11,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,做蟹黄堡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.98,0:16:49.11,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Cooking a Krabby Patty
Dialogue: 1,0:16:50.82,0:16:53.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,接下来的信息量超大  来得又超快
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.82,0:16:52.40,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,There's gonna be a lot of information
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.40,0:16:53.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,coming at you pretty quick
Dialogue: 1,0:16:53.65,0:16:55.66,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,所以可以记笔记
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.65,0:16:55.66,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,so feel free to take notes
Dialogue: 1,0:16:55.95,0:16:58.08,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,煎肉饼  放在面包上
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.95,0:16:58.08,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Cook the patty, put it on the bun
Dialogue: 1,0:16:58.53,0:17:00.79,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,加配料  别忘了另一块面包
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.53,0:17:00.79,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Add the toppings, and don't forget the other bun
Dialogue: 1,0:17:01.25,0:17:02.58,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就这样
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.25,0:17:02.58,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And that's it
Dialogue: 1,0:17:03.71,0:17:05.21,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.71,0:17:05.21,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Beautiful
Dialogue: 1,0:17:05.21,0:17:06.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.21,0:17:06.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Brilliant
Dialogue: 1,0:17:08.75,0:17:10.25,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,多么有感染力
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.75,0:17:10.25,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Such pathos
Dialogue: 1,0:17:10.25,0:17:13.26,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我能感受到那肉饼的每一秒
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.25,0:17:13.26,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I felt every second of that patty
Dialogue: 1,0:17:13.26,0:17:14.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,懂我什么意思吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.26,0:17:14.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You know what I mean?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:14.17,0:17:15.38,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不太懂
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.17,0:17:15.38,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No, not really
Dialogue: 1,0:17:15.38,0:17:16.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,换你试试看
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.38,0:17:16.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Now you try
Dialogue: 1,0:17:20.22,0:17:21.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,做蟹黄堡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.22,0:17:21.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Cook the patty
Dialogue: 1,0:17:21.77,0:17:23.02,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,放在面包上
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.77,0:17:23.02,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,put it on a bun
Dialogue: 1,0:17:23.27,0:17:25.02,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,加配料
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.27,0:17:25.02,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,add the toppings
Dialogue: 1,0:17:25.23,0:17:26.94,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,别忘了另一块面包
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.23,0:17:26.94,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,don't forget the other bun
Dialogue: 1,0:17:27.44,0:17:28.48,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,真棒
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.44,0:17:28.48,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Great
Dialogue: 1,0:17:28.48,0:17:30.11,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你是天生好手
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.48,0:17:30.11,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You're a natural
Dialogue: 1,0:17:30.11,0:17:32.28,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好了  今天就结束了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.11,0:17:32.28,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Okay, that's the end of the day
Dialogue: 1,0:17:32.28,0:17:32.61,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那么
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.28,0:17:32.61,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,so--
Dialogue: 1,0:17:32.94,0:17:34.24,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,感觉不太对
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.94,0:17:34.24,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I don't know
Dialogue: 1,0:17:34.53,0:17:37.74,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,虽然做到了  却感觉很空洞
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.53,0:17:37.74,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I did it, but it felt empty
Dialogue: 1,0:17:38.57,0:17:39.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,可以从头再来吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.57,0:17:39.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Can I go again from the top?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:40.53,0:17:41.54,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,应该可以吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.53,0:17:41.54,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I guess so
Dialogue: 1,0:17:41.54,0:17:43.70,标准-Chi,,0,0,75,,七小时后
Dialogue: 1,0:17:45.46,0:17:46.21,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.46,0:17:46.21,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,There
Dialogue: 1,0:17:46.58,0:17:48.00,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就是这个感觉
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.58,0:17:48.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That's the one
Dialogue: 1,0:17:48.42,0:17:51.71,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,终于正宗了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.42,0:17:51.71,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Finally, authenticity
Dialogue: 1,0:17:52.42,0:17:53.13,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,很好
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.42,0:17:53.13,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Good
Dialogue: 1,0:17:54.46,0:17:56.63,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,终于可以回家了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.46,0:17:56.63,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We can finally go home
Dialogue: 1,0:17:58.68,0:18:00.18,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,晚安  马林
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.68,0:18:00.18,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Night, Marlin
Dialogue: 1,0:18:05.39,0:18:07.06,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我准备好了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.39,0:18:07.06,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm ready
Dialogue: 1,0:18:09.61,0:18:11.86,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,早安  章鱼哥
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.61,0:18:11.86,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Good morning, Squidward
Dialogue: 1,0:18:15.49,0:18:16.70,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.49,0:18:16.70,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,0:18:17.82,0:18:18.74,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.82,0:18:18.74,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute
Dialogue: 1,0:18:18.74,0:18:19.99,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你怎么会在这外面
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.74,0:18:19.99,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,How are you out here?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:19.99,0:18:22.49,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你整个早上不是在厨房备餐吗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.99,0:18:22.49,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I thought you were in the kitchen cooking all morning?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:23.62,0:18:24.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,上菜了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.62,0:18:24.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Order up
Dialogue: 1,0:18:30.54,0:18:32.00,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你在这啊  章鱼哥
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.54,0:18:32.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,There you are, Squidward
Dialogue: 1,0:18:33.09,0:18:35.59,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,快把那餐点端给客人吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.09,0:18:35.59,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Better get that order out to the customer
Dialogue: 1,0:18:35.59,0:18:38.34,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,烤架上还有好多美味的蟹黄堡肉饼呢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.59,0:18:38.34,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I've got lots more tasty Krabby Patties on the grill
Dialogue: 1,0:18:38.51,0:18:40.26,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不好  有
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.51,0:18:40.26,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh, no, it's
Dialogue: 1,0:18:40.47,0:18:42.14,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,两个海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.47,0:18:42.14,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Two SpongeBobs
Dialogue: 1,0:18:44.47,0:18:46.73,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,早该知道你找得到办法
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.47,0:18:46.73,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I should've known you'd find a way
Dialogue: 1,0:18:46.73,0:18:48.77,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,毁掉我最喜欢的演员了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.73,0:18:48.77,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,to ruin my favorite actor
Dialogue: 1,0:18:50.60,0:18:53.73,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好了  摄影机要放在那里那里那里
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.60,0:18:53.73,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Alright, I want cameras there, there, and there
Dialogue: 1,0:18:53.73,0:18:55.32,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,后墙放点灯光
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.73,0:18:55.32,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Let's get some lights up on the back wall
Dialogue: 1,0:18:55.32,0:18:58.74,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,告诉布景师挂点海报什么的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.32,0:18:56.74,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and someone tell Set Dec
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.74,0:18:58.74,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,to put up some posters or something
Dialogue: 1,0:18:58.74,0:19:00.20,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这地方有点太压抑了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.74,0:19:00.20,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,This place is a little too depressing
Dialogue: 1,0:19:01.03,0:19:02.74,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,欢迎导演先生
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.03,0:19:02.74,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Mr. Director, welcome
Dialogue: 1,0:19:02.99,0:19:05.66,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,非常感谢你能花这么多钱来这里
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.99,0:19:05.66,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I really appreciate the money you paid to be here
Dialogue: 1,0:19:05.66,0:19:06.58,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.66,0:19:06.58,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yeah, thanks
Dialogue: 1,0:19:06.91,0:19:09.21,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,介意我们在墙里布点电缆线吗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.91,0:19:09.21,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You mind if we run some cable through this wall?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:10.79,0:19:11.38,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我可不
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.79,0:19:11.38,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I don't
Dialogue: 1,0:19:12.33,0:19:13.71,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不介意
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.33,0:19:13.71,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,mind at all
Dialogue: 1,0:19:13.96,0:19:15.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不如放着让我来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.96,0:19:15.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,In fact, allow me
Dialogue: 1,0:19:20.01,0:19:21.64,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,导演先生
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.01,0:19:21.64,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Mr. Director, sir
Dialogue: 1,0:19:21.64,0:19:23.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,可以看你拍电影吗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.64,0:19:23.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,could I watch you make your movie?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:23.47,0:19:24.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.47,0:19:24.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well
Dialogue: 1,0:19:24.30,0:19:25.14,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.30,0:19:25.14,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,okay
Dialogue: 1,0:19:25.14,0:19:26.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不过就只是你刚好够高
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.14,0:19:26.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,But only because you're the perfect height
Dialogue: 1,0:19:26.47,0:19:27.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,可以帮我端咖啡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.47,0:19:27.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,to hold my coffee
Dialogue: 1,0:19:28.48,0:19:30.81,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,摄影机都准备好
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.48,0:19:30.81,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Alright, let's get the cameras rolling
Dialogue: 1,0:19:30.81,0:19:31.90,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.81,0:19:31.90,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And
Dialogue: 1,0:19:31.90,0:19:33.02,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,开拍
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.90,0:19:33.02,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,action
Dialogue: 1,0:19:35.86,0:19:40.03,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,每天早晨  我都来到同一间厨房工作
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.86,0:19:40.03,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Every morning, I come to work in the same kitchen
Dialogue: 1,0:19:40.28,0:19:42.20,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,戴着同一顶发网
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.28,0:19:42.20,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I wear the same hairnet
Dialogue: 1,0:19:42.45,0:19:44.45,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,用着同一个烤架配餐
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.45,0:19:44.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I cook on the same grill
Dialogue: 1,0:19:46.28,0:19:48.66,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,有人说我浪费了生命
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.28,0:19:48.66,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Some people say I've wasted my life
Dialogue: 1,0:19:49.25,0:19:52.37,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,沉湎于无尽的苦差事
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.25,0:19:52.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,that I've wallowed in a pit of drudgery
Dialogue: 1,0:19:52.37,0:19:53.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我就说
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.37,0:19:53.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, I say
Dialogue: 1,0:19:54.21,0:19:56.46,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我爱苦差事
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.21,0:19:56.46,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I love to drudge
Dialogue: 1,0:19:56.80,0:20:04.18,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我认为  一生追求完美并非是浪费
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.80,0:20:01.93,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I say, a life lived in the pursuit of perfection
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.93,0:20:04.18,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,isn't a life wasted
Dialogue: 1,0:20:04.39,0:20:05.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我说
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.39,0:20:05.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I say
Dialogue: 1,0:20:07.56,0:20:08.93,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,上菜了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.56,0:20:08.93,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Order up
Dialogue: 1,0:20:11.44,0:20:11.98,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,停
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.44,0:20:11.98,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Cut
Dialogue: 1,0:20:17.32,0:20:18.78,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,马林宝贝  干得漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.32,0:20:18.78,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Marlin, baby, you nailed it
Dialogue: 1,0:20:18.78,0:20:20.07,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,刚才真是完美
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.78,0:20:20.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That was perfect
Dialogue: 1,0:20:20.07,0:20:20.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.07,0:20:20.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yeah
Dialogue: 1,0:20:21.95,0:20:23.07,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,有事到我的房车找我
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.95,0:20:23.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'll be in my trailer
Dialogue: 1,0:20:23.07,0:20:23.74,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.07,0:20:23.74,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Alright
Dialogue: 1,0:20:23.74,0:20:26.32,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,接下来拍特效镜头
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.74,0:20:26.32,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Let's move on to the big FX shot
Dialogue: 1,0:20:26.32,0:20:28.20,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,大家清空片场
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.32,0:20:28.20,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Everyone, clear the set
Dialogue: 1,0:20:28.70,0:20:30.83,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,蟹老板  我们也该撤走吗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.70,0:20:30.83,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Mr. Krabs, should we clear too?
Dialogue: 1,0:20:32.87,0:20:34.25,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,别吵  小子
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.87,0:20:34.25,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Pipe down, boy-o
Dialogue: 1,0:20:34.25,0:20:36.21,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我还在享受拍电影赚到的钱呢
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.25,0:20:36.21,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm tryin' to enjoy me movie money
Dialogue: 1,0:20:39.92,0:20:41.26,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,开拍
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.92,0:20:41.26,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Action
Dialogue: 1,0:20:43.34,0:20:43.97,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,停
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.34,0:20:43.97,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Cut
Dialogue: 1,0:20:43.97,0:20:45.26,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,过
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.97,0:20:45.26,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And print
Dialogue: 1,0:20:45.26,0:20:46.22,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,大伙儿收工
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.26,0:20:46.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Let's go, people
Dialogue: 1,0:20:46.43,0:20:48.60,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,三张首映的电影票给你们
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.43,0:20:48.60,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Here's three tickets to the premiere
Dialogue: 1,0:20:48.60,0:20:49.97,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,感谢你们参与电影的魔力
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.60,0:20:49.97,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Thanks for being part of the magic
Dialogue: 1,0:20:49.97,0:20:56.19,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,至少电影有助于宣传蟹堡王  对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.97,0:20:53.02,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, at least the movie will be
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.02,0:20:56.19,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,good advertising for the Krusty Krab, right?
Dialogue: 1,0:20:59.11,0:21:02.57,标准-Chi,,0,0,75,,做了两到三年后期后
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.57,0:21:05.20,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1354,428)}礁石影院
Dialogue: 1,0:21:05.74,0:21:06.41,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不好意思
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.74,0:21:06.41,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Pardon me
Dialogue: 1,0:21:06.70,0:21:07.32,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不好意思
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.70,0:21:07.32,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Pardon me
Dialogue: 1,0:21:07.32,0:21:07.99,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不好意思
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.32,0:21:07.99,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Pardon me
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.16,0:21:16.00,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(648,226)}海神王十四世影业
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.75,0:21:18.96,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(942,1010)}底栖生物制片公司
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.67,0:21:21.67,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1010)}裤头村电影娱乐企业\N一分钱上的人制片公司\N巨影院\N\N联合出品
Dialogue: 1,0:21:22.84,0:21:23.63,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,蟹老板
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.84,0:21:23.63,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Mr. Krabs
Dialogue: 1,0:21:23.63,0:21:24.59,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,开演了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.63,0:21:24.59,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,There it is
Dialogue: 1,0:21:28.35,0:21:29.60,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,上菜了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.35,0:21:29.60,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Order up
Dialogue: 1,0:21:37.23,0:21:39.19,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这部电影太精彩了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.23,0:21:39.19,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,This movie is incredible
Dialogue: 1,0:21:39.19,0:21:41.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这部电影就是垃圾
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.19,0:21:41.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,This movie is garbage
Dialogue: 1,0:21:41.65,0:21:43.53,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这部电影结束了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.65,0:21:43.53,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,This movie is over
Dialogue: 1,0:21:43.90,0:21:44.53,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,走了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.90,0:21:44.53,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Come on
Dialogue: 1,0:21:46.57,0:21:49.32,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,可我还想看机器人会不会相爱呢
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.57,0:21:49.32,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,But I wanna see if the robots fall in love
Dialogue: 1,0:21:50.24,0:21:51.74,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,真不敢相信
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.24,0:21:51.74,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I can't believe it
Dialogue: 1,0:21:51.74,0:21:54.33,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我餐厅第一幕就被炸了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.74,0:21:54.33,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,They blew me restaurant up in the very first scene
Dialogue: 1,0:21:54.33,0:21:56.46,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,连招牌都看不到
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.33,0:21:56.46,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You couldn't even see the sign
Dialogue: 1,0:21:56.92,0:21:58.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,太坑了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.92,0:21:58.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What a rip-off
Dialogue: 1,0:21:58.46,0:22:02.21,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,当初怎么会粉上那个三流戏子
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.46,0:22:02.21,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,How did I ever admire that lousy hack
Dialogue: 1,0:22:02.21,0:22:04.05,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,马林白鲈度
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.21,0:22:04.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Marlin Branzino?
Dialogue: 1,0:22:04.05,0:22:05.26,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,马林
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.05,0:22:05.26,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hey, Marlin
Dialogue: 1,0:22:05.76,0:22:07.51,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,来看首映的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.76,0:22:07.51,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Here for the big premiere?
Dialogue: 1,0:22:07.72,0:22:08.59,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不是
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.72,0:22:08.59,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No way, man
Dialogue: 1,0:22:09.01,0:22:11.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我从不看自己的戏
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.01,0:22:11.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I never watch myself on the screen
Dialogue: 1,0:22:11.68,0:22:14.31,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我是来排练我的下一个角色
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.68,0:22:14.31,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm here to start practicing for my next role as
Dialogue: 1,0:22:18.73,0:22:21.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,烦人的收银员
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.73,0:22:21.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,an annoying cashier
Dialogue: 1,0:22:27.36,0:22:29.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,拜托把你的智慧给我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.36,0:22:29.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Please, give me your wisdom
Dialogue: 1,0:22:30.32,0:22:32.03,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你的一本旧杂志
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.32,0:22:32.03,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,One of your old magazines?
Dialogue: 1,0:22:32.41,0:22:33.79,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,用过的家具装饰垫
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.41,0:22:33.79,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,A used doily?
Dialogue: 1,0:22:34.04,0:22:35.00,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,什么都行
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.04,0:22:35.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Anything
Dialogue: 1,0:22:35.37,0:22:36.25,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.37,0:22:36.25,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And
Dialogue: 1,0:22:36.50,0:22:37.04,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,停
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.50,0:22:37.04,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,cut
Dialogue: 1,0:22:37.37,0:22:38.37,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,漂亮  过
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.37,0:22:38.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Beautiful, print it
Dialogue: 1,0:22:38.37,0:22:39.21,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,杀青了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.37,0:22:39.21,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That's a wrap
